        {
            "id": "https://tingyinglu.com/the-backbone.html",
            "url": "https://tingyinglu.com/the-backbone.html",
            "title": "The Backbone",
            "summary": "｜The Backbone・後盾｜ Life can sometimes feel like an unpredictable storm. When one&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p>｜The Backbone・<span class=\"s1\">後盾｜</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\">Life can sometimes feel like an unpredictable storm. When one life is held by another, where does that strength truly come from? A child may become the reason a parent keeps moving forward, while a parent may be a child’s first source of support in facing the world.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\">Perhaps a backbone is not simply about protecting or being protected, but about becoming the strength that allows another to keep going. Perhaps the true backbone has always been each other.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>生命有時像一場無法預測的風雨。當一個生命被另一個生命托住，支撐究竟來自哪裡？孩子是父母持續向前的理由，父母也是孩子面對世界時最初的依靠。</p>\n<p class=\"p1\">所謂後盾，或許並不只是保護與被保護的關係，而是在彼此的存在之中，成為繼續走下去的力量。真正的後盾，也許從來都是彼此。</p>\n<p>W19.5 x D16.5 x H48.5 cm<br>Jindai wood <span class=\"s1\">神代木</span></p>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/28/20260808_Shen-Dai-Mu_iPhone_LSide_01-Da.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"702\" height=\"878\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/28/responsive/20260808_Shen-Dai-Mu_iPhone_LSide_01-Da-xs.jpeg 300w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/28/responsive/20260808_Shen-Dai-Mu_iPhone_LSide_01-Da-sm.jpeg 480w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/28/responsive/20260808_Shen-Dai-Mu_iPhone_LSide_01-Da-md.jpeg 768w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/28/responsive/20260808_Shen-Dai-Mu_iPhone_LSide_01-Da-lg.jpeg 1024w\">\n<figcaption>The Backbone 後盾｜2026</figcaption>\n</figure>",
            "image": "https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/28/20260808_Shen-Dai-Mu_iPhone_45Side_01_Feature_683x500_01.jpg",
            "author": {
