        {
            "id": "https://tingyinglu.com/beneath-appearances.html",
            "url": "https://tingyinglu.com/beneath-appearances.html",
            "title": "Beneath Appearances ",
            "summary": "｜Beneath Appearances・表象之下｜ A seemingly formidable polar bear sits on a drifting ice&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p>｜Beneath Appearances・表象之下｜</p>\n<p class=\"p1\">A seemingly formidable polar bear sits on a drifting ice floe. Its hard exterior contrasts with a soft interior that slowly emerges through cracks. It’s a simple but often overlooked idea: what we see is usually only the surface. When perception stops there, understanding can easily become distorted. What truly defines a person tends to remain unseen. Exterior and interior are not opposites; they simply require time to be understood.</p>\n<p class=\"p1\">看似強大的北極熊靜坐於浮冰之上，外殼堅硬，內部柔軟，並從裂縫中緩慢流出。這是簡單卻常被忽略的事：我們往往只看見表面。當理解停留於表面，就容易產生偏差與誤判。真正構成一個人的部分，往往隱藏在不被注意之處。外與內並非對立，只是需要時間去被看見。</p>\n<p>L130 x W230 x H112<br>Dimensions variable 尺寸可視場地調整<br>Ceramic, found object. 陶瓷、現成物</p>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/26/Shen-Si-Bei-Ji-Xiong_02_01_S-Da.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"702\" height=\"1053\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/26/responsive/Shen-Si-Bei-Ji-Xiong_02_01_S-Da-xs.jpeg 300w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/26/responsive/Shen-Si-Bei-Ji-Xiong_02_01_S-Da-sm.jpeg 480w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/26/responsive/Shen-Si-Bei-Ji-Xiong_02_01_S-Da-md.jpeg 768w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/26/responsive/Shen-Si-Bei-Ji-Xiong_02_01_S-Da-lg.jpeg 1024w\">\n<figcaption>Beneath Appearances 表象之下｜2026</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/26/Shen-Si-Bei-Ji-Xiong_03_01_S-Da.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"702\" height=\"1053\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/26/responsive/Shen-Si-Bei-Ji-Xiong_03_01_S-Da-xs.jpeg 300w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/26/responsive/Shen-Si-Bei-Ji-Xiong_03_01_S-Da-sm.jpeg 480w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/26/responsive/Shen-Si-Bei-Ji-Xiong_03_01_S-Da-md.jpeg 768w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/26/responsive/Shen-Si-Bei-Ji-Xiong_03_01_S-Da-lg.jpeg 1024w\">\n<figcaption>Beneath Appearances 表象之下｜2026</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/26/Shen-Si-Bei-Ji-Xiong_06_01-Da.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"702\" height=\"1053\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/26/responsive/Shen-Si-Bei-Ji-Xiong_06_01-Da-xs.jpeg 300w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/26/responsive/Shen-Si-Bei-Ji-Xiong_06_01-Da-sm.jpeg 480w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/26/responsive/Shen-Si-Bei-Ji-Xiong_06_01-Da-md.jpeg 768w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/26/responsive/Shen-Si-Bei-Ji-Xiong_06_01-Da-lg.jpeg 1024w\">\n<figcaption>Beneath Appearances 表象之下｜2026</figcaption>\n</figure>",
            "image": "https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/26/Shen-Si-Bei-Ji-Xiong_06_01_Feature_683x500_01.jpg",
