            "id": "https://tingyinglu.com/turning-a-blind-eye.html",
            "url": "https://tingyinglu.com/turning-a-blind-eye.html",
            "title": "Turning a Blind Eye",
            "summary": "｜Turning a Blind Eye・視而不見｜ A subtle distortion appears on the floor, resembling&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p>｜Turning a Blind Eye・視而不見｜</p>\n<p class=\"p1\">A subtle distortion appears on the floor, resembling faint irregularities in everyday life. It exists, yet remains barely visible; it is seen, yet easily ignored. Over time, turning a blind eye becomes a strategy—allowing one to live with others or oneself. Sometimes, turning a blind eye can be a choice—or simply a condition one must endure. One has to turn a blind eye to so much of oneself in order to get through life.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\">地面出現細微變形，如同日常中不易察覺的異樣。它存在，卻不夠明顯；被看見，卻容易被忽略。視而不見有時是一種策略，使人得以與他人或自我共處；或是一種選擇；有時是一種不得不然的處境。有時，為了度過一生，人不得不對自身那麼多的東西視而不見。</p>\n<p>16.5 Meter<br>Site-specific art 限地創作<br>Plastic, paint 塑膠布、漆</p>\n<p> </p>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/25/Shi-Er-Bu-Jian_02_01-Da.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"702\" height=\"702\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/25/responsive/Shi-Er-Bu-Jian_02_01-Da-xs.jpeg 300w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/25/responsive/Shi-Er-Bu-Jian_02_01-Da-sm.jpeg 480w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/25/responsive/Shi-Er-Bu-Jian_02_01-Da-md.jpeg 768w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/25/responsive/Shi-Er-Bu-Jian_02_01-Da-lg.jpeg 1024w\">\n<figcaption>Turning a Blind Eye 視而不見｜2026</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/25/Shi-Er-Bu-Jian_05_01-Da.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"702\" height=\"468\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/25/responsive/Shi-Er-Bu-Jian_05_01-Da-xs.jpeg 300w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/25/responsive/Shi-Er-Bu-Jian_05_01-Da-sm.jpeg 480w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/25/responsive/Shi-Er-Bu-Jian_05_01-Da-md.jpeg 768w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/25/responsive/Shi-Er-Bu-Jian_05_01-Da-lg.jpeg 1024w\">\n<figcaption>Turning a Blind Eye 視而不見｜2026</figcaption>\n</figure>",
            "image": "https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/25/Shi-Er-Bu-Jian_01_01_features_683x500_01.jpg",
            "author": {
                "name": "Ting Lu"
