        {
            "id": "https://tingyinglu.com/evidence-in-tears.html",
            "url": "https://tingyinglu.com/evidence-in-tears.html",
            "title": "Evidence in Tears",
            "summary": "｜Evidence in Tears・流動的證據｜ Beginning with a single tear, the work expands into&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p>｜Evidence in Tears・流動的證據｜</p>\n<p class=\"p1\">Beginning with a single tear, the work expands into multiple states of being. Scored ceramic surfaces record repetition and failure; gold leaf marks flashes of achievement; transparent glass suggests clarity after understanding—whether acceptance or release. Tears belong not only to sorrow but also to joy, success, injustice, and emotional impact. What appears as a visible single moment is formed through countless unseen accumulations.</p>\n<p class=\"p1\">由一滴眼淚延展為多重形式狀態。陶瓷上的刻痕記錄反覆嘗試與挫敗，金箔象徵成就的光芒，玻璃的清透則指向理解之後的瞬間清晰<span class=\"s1\">——</span>無論是接納或放手。眼淚不僅來自悲傷，也源於喜悅、委屈與被觸動的時刻。那些被看見的瞬間，實則由無數未被察覺的情緒層層累積而成。</p>\n<p>L115 x W65 x H 39 cm<br>Dimensions variable 尺寸可視場地調整<br>Resin, Ceramic, glass, gold leaf. 固化樹脂、陶瓷、玻璃、金箔</p>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/24/Yan-Lei_Liu-Dong-De-Zheng-Ju_S_0_8-Da-01.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"702\" height=\"702\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/24/responsive/Yan-Lei_Liu-Dong-De-Zheng-Ju_S_0_8-Da-01-xs.jpg 300w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/24/responsive/Yan-Lei_Liu-Dong-De-Zheng-Ju_S_0_8-Da-01-sm.jpg 480w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/24/responsive/Yan-Lei_Liu-Dong-De-Zheng-Ju_S_0_8-Da-01-md.jpg 768w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/24/responsive/Yan-Lei_Liu-Dong-De-Zheng-Ju_S_0_8-Da-01-lg.jpg 1024w\">\n<figcaption>Evidence in Tears 流動的證據｜2026</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/24/Yan-Lei_Liu-Dong-De-Zheng-Ju_S_0_2-Da.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"702\" height=\"562\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/24/responsive/Yan-Lei_Liu-Dong-De-Zheng-Ju_S_0_2-Da-xs.jpeg 300w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/24/responsive/Yan-Lei_Liu-Dong-De-Zheng-Ju_S_0_2-Da-sm.jpeg 480w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/24/responsive/Yan-Lei_Liu-Dong-De-Zheng-Ju_S_0_2-Da-md.jpeg 768w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/24/responsive/Yan-Lei_Liu-Dong-De-Zheng-Ju_S_0_2-Da-lg.jpeg 1024w\">\n<figcaption>Evidence in Tears 流動的證據｜2026</figcaption>\n</figure>",
            "image": "https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/24/Yan-Lei_Liu-Dong-De-Zheng-Ju_S_0_6_Feature_683x500_01.jpg",
            "author": {
                "name": "Ting Lu"
            },
            "tags": [
