        {
            "id": "https://tingyinglu.com/the-shape-of-absence.html",
            "url": "https://tingyinglu.com/the-shape-of-absence.html",
            "title": "The Shape of Absence",
            "summary": "｜The Shape of Absence・無形之形｜ A girl wears a Viking helmet, symbol of&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p>｜The Shape of Absence・無形之形｜</p>\n<p class=\"p1\">A girl wears a Viking helmet, symbol of courage. In her arms is no real cat, but a silhouette rendered in Nashiji-urushi lacquer—a tribute to a cat who shared nearly twenty years of life. After her passing, memories flash like distant fireworks—brief, bright, and lingering. This shadow is more than a pet’s form; it marks the imprint of all we’ve loved and lost. When someone is gone, does love remain? This work quietly asks: what truly exists, and what is unseen yet endures? In loss, we search for meaning—and gather the courage to keep walking.</p>\n<p class=\"p1\">小女孩戴著象徵勇氣的維京帽，懷中所抱，並非真實之物，而是一道以梨子地漆描繪的貓影<span class=\"s1\">——</span>一隻陪伴將近二十年的老貓。牠離開後，記憶如煙火乍現，殘光閃爍，卻揮之不去。這道剪影，不只是一隻貓的輪廓，更是每段逝去關係的痕跡。當摯愛不再，愛本身是否仍存在？什麼是真正的存在？什麼是無形卻永不消失的？在失去中尋找答案，從悲傷中汲取前行的勇氣。</p>\n<p>W31 x D24 x H67 cm<br>Camphor wood, Gold leaf, Nashiji-urushi 樟木、金箔、梨子地漆</p>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/23/2025Mu-Diao_Wu-Xing-Zhi-Xing-The-Shape-of-Absence_014-Da.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"702\" height=\"936\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/23/responsive/2025Mu-Diao_Wu-Xing-Zhi-Xing-The-Shape-of-Absence_014-Da-xs.jpeg 300w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/23/responsive/2025Mu-Diao_Wu-Xing-Zhi-Xing-The-Shape-of-Absence_014-Da-sm.jpeg 480w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/23/responsive/2025Mu-Diao_Wu-Xing-Zhi-Xing-The-Shape-of-Absence_014-Da-md.jpeg 768w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/23/responsive/2025Mu-Diao_Wu-Xing-Zhi-Xing-The-Shape-of-Absence_014-Da-lg.jpeg 1024w\">\n<figcaption>The Shape of Absence 無形之形｜2025</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/23/2025Mu-Diao_Wu-Xing-Zhi-Xing-The-Shape-of-Absence_010-Da.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"702\" height=\"936\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/23/responsive/2025Mu-Diao_Wu-Xing-Zhi-Xing-The-Shape-of-Absence_010-Da-xs.jpeg 300w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/23/responsive/2025Mu-Diao_Wu-Xing-Zhi-Xing-The-Shape-of-Absence_010-Da-sm.jpeg 480w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/23/responsive/2025Mu-Diao_Wu-Xing-Zhi-Xing-The-Shape-of-Absence_010-Da-md.jpeg 768w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/23/responsive/2025Mu-Diao_Wu-Xing-Zhi-Xing-The-Shape-of-Absence_010-Da-lg.jpeg 1024w\">\n<figcaption>The Shape of Absence 無形之形｜2025</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/23/2025Mu-Diao_Wu-Xing-Zhi-Xing-The-Shape-of-Absence_028-Da.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"702\" height=\"936\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/23/responsive/2025Mu-Diao_Wu-Xing-Zhi-Xing-The-Shape-of-Absence_028-Da-xs.jpeg 300w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/23/responsive/2025Mu-Diao_Wu-Xing-Zhi-Xing-The-Shape-of-Absence_028-Da-sm.jpeg 480w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/23/responsive/2025Mu-Diao_Wu-Xing-Zhi-Xing-The-Shape-of-Absence_028-Da-md.jpeg 768w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/23/responsive/2025Mu-Diao_Wu-Xing-Zhi-Xing-The-Shape-of-Absence_028-Da-lg.jpeg 1024w\">\n<figcaption>The Shape of Absence 無形之形｜2025</figcaption>\n</figure>",
