        {
            "id": "https://tingyinglu.com/silent-realm.html",
            "url": "https://tingyinglu.com/silent-realm.html",
            "title": "Silent Realm",
            "summary": "｜Silent Realm・靜境｜ The girl becomes a polar bear. Eyes closed—silent, not weak.",
            "content_html": "<p>｜Silent Realm・靜境｜</p>\n<p class=\"p1\">The girl becomes a polar bear. Eyes closed—silent, not weak. She longs for resilience, for poise that walks unshaken. White stands at the edge of fragility and strength—a quiet discipline. Stillness, firm. Unyielding. This is not retreat, but refinement. The polar bear does not fear, does not waver. Its power is restraint. Its courage lives in calm. A girl becomes a polar bear—eyes closed, still but strong. She longs for resilience, for poise in the face of fear. White stands at the edge of fragility and strength. Form is white. Will is steel. Eyes closed, yet the path is clear. Fragility is not failure, but the threshold of change. Within silence lies precision. No sound, yet full of forward force. A threshold of quiet transformation. Bold. Wordless. Unshaken.</p>\n<p class=\"p1\">女孩化為北極熊，雙眼闔上，靜而不弱。她渴望那份韌性與沉著，能無懼前行。白，是脆弱與力量之間的臨界，一場無聲的修煉，靜默、堅定、毫不退讓。這不是逃避，而是一種向內的凝鍊。北極熊不怒、不懼、不動如冰。它的力量來自節制，它的勇氣藏於安靜。女孩化為北極熊，雙眼闔上，靜而不弱。她渴望那份韌性與沉著，能無懼前行。白，是脆弱與力量之間的臨界，形體純白，意志堅定。閉眼，不代表退讓，而是看見內在的路。脆弱不再是缺陷，而是一種準備，一種轉化的前奏。沉靜之中，有一種鋒利，無需聲音，卻足以前行。一場無聲的修煉，靜默、堅定、毫不退讓。</p>\n<p>L48 x W42 x H61 cm<br>Ceramic 陶瓷</p>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/22/2025Gong-Yi-Mei-Shu-Zu_Jing-Jing_S_04-Da.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"702\" height=\"948\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/22/responsive/2025Gong-Yi-Mei-Shu-Zu_Jing-Jing_S_04-Da-xs.jpeg 300w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/22/responsive/2025Gong-Yi-Mei-Shu-Zu_Jing-Jing_S_04-Da-sm.jpeg 480w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/22/responsive/2025Gong-Yi-Mei-Shu-Zu_Jing-Jing_S_04-Da-md.jpeg 768w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/22/responsive/2025Gong-Yi-Mei-Shu-Zu_Jing-Jing_S_04-Da-lg.jpeg 1024w\">\n<figcaption>Silent Realm 靜境｜2025</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/22/2025Gong-Yi-Mei-Shu-Zu_Jing-Jing_S_02-Da.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"702\" height=\"936\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/22/responsive/2025Gong-Yi-Mei-Shu-Zu_Jing-Jing_S_02-Da-xs.jpeg 300w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/22/responsive/2025Gong-Yi-Mei-Shu-Zu_Jing-Jing_S_02-Da-sm.jpeg 480w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/22/responsive/2025Gong-Yi-Mei-Shu-Zu_Jing-Jing_S_02-Da-md.jpeg 768w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/22/responsive/2025Gong-Yi-Mei-Shu-Zu_Jing-Jing_S_02-Da-lg.jpeg 1024w\">\n<figcaption>Silent Realm 靜境｜2025</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/22/2025Gong-Yi-Mei-Shu-Zu_Jing-Jing_S_03-Da.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"702\" height=\"936\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/22/responsive/2025Gong-Yi-Mei-Shu-Zu_Jing-Jing_S_03-Da-xs.jpeg 300w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/22/responsive/2025Gong-Yi-Mei-Shu-Zu_Jing-Jing_S_03-Da-sm.jpeg 480w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/22/responsive/2025Gong-Yi-Mei-Shu-Zu_Jing-Jing_S_03-Da-md.jpeg 768w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/22/responsive/2025Gong-Yi-Mei-Shu-Zu_Jing-Jing_S_03-Da-lg.jpeg 1024w\">\n<figcaption>Silent Realm 靜境｜2025</figcaption>\n</figure>",
