            "id": "https://tingyinglu.com/the-sweet-grand-lie.html",
            "url": "https://tingyinglu.com/the-sweet-grand-lie.html",
            "title": "The Sweet Grand Lie",
            "summary": "｜The Sweet Grand Lie・甜美大謊言｜ “Wonderful World” stands as a metaphor of truth&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p>｜The Sweet Grand Lie・甜美大謊言｜</p>\n<p class=\"p1\">“Wonderful World” stands as a metaphor of truth wrapped in sweet packagings. Its charm disarms, turning desire into justification. When happiness becomes a marketing language, overconsumption slips quietly into normal life. Recycling slogans echo, yet plastics still rise, oceans still choke, and e-waste keeps spreading. Layered without reflection, it grows into a weight the planet can no longer bear. We live within this polished illusion, forgetting who pays for it. The work is not an accusation but a reminder: every purchase defines where awareness begins. knowing what we need, not what we’re told to want.</p>\n<p class=\"p1\">「<span class=\"s1\">Wonderful World</span>美好世界」暗喻被糖衣包裹的真相。甜美的外表讓人放下戒心，也讓慾望合理化。當幸福成為銷售語言，過度消費便被視為日常的一部分。回收的口號遍地，卻無法掩蓋塑膠堆積、海洋受損、電子廢棄物流竄的現實。在不加反思地堆疊下，成為地球難以承受的重量。我們在「美好世界」的幻象裡安然生活，卻忘了誰在為此買單。這件作品不是指責，而是一種提醒<span class=\"s1\">——</span>在每一次消費之前，辨別真正的需要與被塑造的慾望。</p>\n<p>L122 x W91 x H14.5cm<br>Dimensions variable 尺寸可視場地調整<br>Ceramic 陶瓷</p>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/21/2025_Tian-Mei-Da-Huang-Yan_S_07-Da-2.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"702\" height=\"468\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/21/responsive/2025_Tian-Mei-Da-Huang-Yan_S_07-Da-2-xs.jpeg 300w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/21/responsive/2025_Tian-Mei-Da-Huang-Yan_S_07-Da-2-sm.jpeg 480w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/21/responsive/2025_Tian-Mei-Da-Huang-Yan_S_07-Da-2-md.jpeg 768w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/21/responsive/2025_Tian-Mei-Da-Huang-Yan_S_07-Da-2-lg.jpeg 1024w\">\n<figcaption>The Sweet Grand Lie 甜美大謊言｜2025</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/21/2025_Tian-Mei-Da-Huang-Yan_S_03-Da.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"702\" height=\"468\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/21/responsive/2025_Tian-Mei-Da-Huang-Yan_S_03-Da-xs.jpeg 300w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/21/responsive/2025_Tian-Mei-Da-Huang-Yan_S_03-Da-sm.jpeg 480w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/21/responsive/2025_Tian-Mei-Da-Huang-Yan_S_03-Da-md.jpeg 768w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/21/responsive/2025_Tian-Mei-Da-Huang-Yan_S_03-Da-lg.jpeg 1024w\">\n<figcaption>The Sweet Grand Lie 甜美大謊言｜2025</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/21/2025_Tian-Mei-Da-Huang-Yan_S_05-Da.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"702\" height=\"468\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/21/responsive/2025_Tian-Mei-Da-Huang-Yan_S_05-Da-xs.jpeg 300w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/21/responsive/2025_Tian-Mei-Da-Huang-Yan_S_05-Da-sm.jpeg 480w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/21/responsive/2025_Tian-Mei-Da-Huang-Yan_S_05-Da-md.jpeg 768w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/21/responsive/2025_Tian-Mei-Da-Huang-Yan_S_05-Da-lg.jpeg 1024w\">\n<figcaption>The Sweet Grand Lie 甜美大謊言｜2025</figcaption>\n</figure>",
