        {
            "id": "https://tingyinglu.com/and-you.html",
            "url": "https://tingyinglu.com/and-you.html",
            "title": "And You? ",
            "summary": "｜And You? 你呢?｜ Using the “whale fall” as metaphor, the work reflects&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p>｜And You? 你呢?｜</p>\n<p>Using the “whale fall” as metaphor, the work reflects on the cycle of life and renewal. When a whale sinks into the deep, its body becomes nourishment for the ocean, sustaining ecosystems for decades. Death, then, is no longer an end, but a quiet act of exchange and giving. When our own lives come to stillness, can we too leave something that sustains others? Can the weight we carry in existence become a force of continuation beyond ourselves? And you? <span class=\"s1\">Ｗ</span>hat do you want to leave to the world?</p>\n<p class=\"p1\">以「鯨落」為隱喻，探討生命的遞循與再生。「鯨落」<span class=\"s1\">——</span>當巨鯨死後沈入海底，其軀體化為萬物的養分，能滋養整個生態系統數十年，延續生命於死亡之後。這是一場關於消逝與延續的對話，關於存在的重量與意義。死亡不再是終點，而是一場持續的交換與給予。當一切歸於靜止，我們能否仍為世界留下養分？你呢？你想能為世界留下什麼？</p>\n<p>W17 x D9 x H25 cm<br>Lime wood, walnut, acrylic paint 椴木、胡桃木、壓克力顏料</p>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/20/Jing-Luo_Ni-Ni_05-Da.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"702\" height=\"936\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/20/responsive/Jing-Luo_Ni-Ni_05-Da-xs.jpeg 300w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/20/responsive/Jing-Luo_Ni-Ni_05-Da-sm.jpeg 480w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/20/responsive/Jing-Luo_Ni-Ni_05-Da-md.jpeg 768w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/20/responsive/Jing-Luo_Ni-Ni_05-Da-lg.jpeg 1024w\">\n<figcaption>And You? 你呢? ｜2025</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/20/Jing-Luo_Ni-Ni_06-Da.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"702\" height=\"936\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/20/responsive/Jing-Luo_Ni-Ni_06-Da-xs.jpeg 300w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/20/responsive/Jing-Luo_Ni-Ni_06-Da-sm.jpeg 480w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/20/responsive/Jing-Luo_Ni-Ni_06-Da-md.jpeg 768w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/20/responsive/Jing-Luo_Ni-Ni_06-Da-lg.jpeg 1024w\">\n<figcaption>And You? 你呢? ｜2025</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/20/Jing-Luo_Ni-Ni_02-Da-2.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"702\" height=\"936\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/20/responsive/Jing-Luo_Ni-Ni_02-Da-2-xs.jpeg 300w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/20/responsive/Jing-Luo_Ni-Ni_02-Da-2-sm.jpeg 480w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/20/responsive/Jing-Luo_Ni-Ni_02-Da-2-md.jpeg 768w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/20/responsive/Jing-Luo_Ni-Ni_02-Da-2-lg.jpeg 1024w\">\n<figcaption>And You? 你呢? ｜2025</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<p class=\"p1\"> </p>",
