            "id": "https://tingyinglu.com/gracefully-let-go.html",
            "url": "https://tingyinglu.com/gracefully-let-go.html",
            "title": "Gracefully let go ",
            "summary": "｜Gracefully let go・優雅地放下｜ Letting go is never easy. It demands determination, perseverance,&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p>｜Gracefully let go・優雅地放下｜</p>\n<p class=\"p1\">Letting go is never easy. It demands determination, perseverance, and courage. To let go with grace and gentleness, without emotional disturbance, is as difficult as keeping a feather suspended in the same place in mid-air. The eagle feather, a symbol of courage, embodies the quiet strength of letting go—firm yet gentle, resilient yet soft.</p>\n<p class=\"p1\">「放下」任何人、事、物，本就不易，需要強大的決心、毅力與勇氣才能完成。要做到優雅、輕柔，沒有任何情緒起伏，就像是試圖把羽毛維持漂浮在半空中同個位置般困難。</p>\n<p class=\"p1\">以象徵勇氣的鷹羽，體現「優雅地放下」剛柔並濟的堅毅與柔軟。<span class=\"s1\"><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></p>\n<p>L 285 x D 110 x H 110 mm<br>Camphor wood<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> <span class=\"s1\">樟木</span></span></p>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/19/2024_WoodFeather_06-Da.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"702\" height=\"936\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/19/responsive/2024_WoodFeather_06-Da-xs.jpeg 300w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/19/responsive/2024_WoodFeather_06-Da-sm.jpeg 480w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/19/responsive/2024_WoodFeather_06-Da-md.jpeg 768w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/19/responsive/2024_WoodFeather_06-Da-lg.jpeg 1024w\">\n<figcaption>Gracefully let go 優雅地放下｜2024</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/19/2024_WoodFeather_07-Da.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"702\" height=\"936\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" srcset=\"https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/19/responsive/2024_WoodFeather_07-Da-xs.jpeg 300w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/19/responsive/2024_WoodFeather_07-Da-sm.jpeg 480w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/19/responsive/2024_WoodFeather_07-Da-md.jpeg 768w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/19/responsive/2024_WoodFeather_07-Da-lg.jpeg 1024w\">\n<figcaption>Gracefully let go 優雅地放下｜2024</figcaption>\n</figure>",
